      "value": "@{5f3287055bc2dc276e0f1630|full_name}: Ah damn that does blow.. As for the detection part, yes i agree, vrchat should fix their shit and actually start banning people, or at least warn them. It’s clearly not difficult at all to detect a malicious / hacked client.",
